', N'installation of breather, sample port, vacuum brake and quick connect', N'10006', N'01 - Imagens/01 - Antes/9617.jpeg', N'Prior to the improvements, this gearbox "223-312-PXE-002" was operated without a dedicated breather, oil sampling port, quick‑connect fitting, or oil tag. Maintenance activities such as oil sampling and servicing where difficult to complete without proper attachments , which increased the potential for contamination and inconsistent oil sample quality. The lack of clear lubrication tag, created a risk of incorrect oil selection during servicing, while limited accessibility increased maintenance time and handling. These conditions reduced repeatability of maintenance tasks and presented avoidable risks to the control and safe handling of oil and equipment reliability.', N'01 - Imagens/02 - Depois/9617.jpeg', N'Lubrication team installed a breather, oil sampling port, quick‑connect fitting, vacuum braker and oil tag on 223-312-PXE-002. Purpose of installation is to improve ventilation, enable safe and consistent oil sampling, streamline oil servicing, and clearly identify lubricants. These upgrades align with site lubrication and reliability standards, supporting standardized maintenance best practices. The improvements reduce contamination risk, improve oil sample quality, minimize maintenance downtime, and lower the likelihood of lubricant cross‑contamination, resulting in increased equipment reliability, and improved safety, ', NULL, N'yes, the problem is not solved. oil should now have what it needs to remain healthy. 
we are also able to replace oil in a faster cleaner way ', N'Having the right set-up makes all the difference ', 0, NULL, N'Ganho no tempo de coleta dos resíduos com mais segurança. ', '2026-04-26T00:00:00.000', '2026-04-27T11:51:34.000', N'81057857', NULL, NULL);
