 Se os procedimentos de segurança forem seguidos.', N'A ausência de pontos de apoio adequados aumenta significativamente o risco de quedas e acidentes durante o acesso ao topo do motor.', 0, NULL, N'Time save.', '2026-05-04T00:00:00.000', '2026-05-05T08:41:20.000', N'81006946', NULL, NULL);
Manual chain hoists however, sometimes requires excessive pulling on the chain operated hoist which can cause strain on personnel. We have had many uses for an electric chain hoist, so why not do a cost comparison between renting and purchasing our own?
Complete. We then fetched approval for purchase and now we have the 2000 pound Electric Chain Hoist in possession.', N'Reduce Manual Efforts, Improve Ergonomic Function', N'10193', N'01 - Imagens/01 - Antes/9880.jpeg', N'As stated previously, these manual chain hoists are a necessity within maintenance. These units require the user to physically pull on a chain which is connected to an internal gear which allows mechanical advantage to hoist a heavy item with ease. They''re great.
But... there are some jobs that scream Electric Chain Hoist.
This was an easy conclusion.
Repetitive hoist operations for loads up to 2000 pounds... Hang the hoist and press a button on a pendant control to raise and lower the load.', N'01 - Imagens/02 - Depois/9880.jpeg', N'Here we have it. Crated up for easy handling with a tow motor. Front of crate labeled with contents. Chain Hoist labeled with net weight of hoist. Annual Inspection completed and recorded by Martech Inspection.
First job it will be used on is over at the CU/FE Press to lower old plates down through bombay doors and then to hoist the new plates up and into place.', NULL, N'Problem was solved diligently and effectively.', N'Work Smarter, Not Harder', 0, NULL, N'REDUÇAO DE RISCO  A EPOSIÇÃO DE PESSOAS A PRODUTO QUIMICO', '2026-05-04T00:00:00.000', '2026-05-05T11:22:32.000', N'81031229', NULL, NULL);
