With all of the cuts from 2024, anyone who knew what they were doing Aconex wise in Voisey’s Bay was gone, and there was nobody to make the decision to archive the project. There were over 1500 users still on the project costing $32.53 per user per month.
 
Being an Aconex administrator for Vale, I had the ability to see that the project was no longer in use and archive it.
 
FYI there is another project that is not in my scope that I have archived since it is not being used in Aconex (Thompson), but I am still waiting on information on how much we have saved by archiving it.
', N'Keep on Top of Unused Projects in Aconex', N'10238', N'01 - Imagens/01 - Antes/9901.jpeg', N'I confirmed with Oracle that by archiving the Voisey’s Bay project (which was not my project, not my responsibility, outside of my scope entirely) which has been completed and not been used since June 30th of 2025, I have saved the company $585,540.00 per year. 
 
With all of the cuts from 2024, anyone who knew what they were doing Aconex wise in Voisey’s Bay was gone, and there was nobody to make the decision to archive the project. There were over 1500 users still on the project costing $32.53 per user per month.
 
Being an Aconex administrator for Vale, I had the ability to see that the project was no longer in use and archive it.
 
FYI there is another project that is not in my scope that I have archived since it is not being used in Aconex (Thompson), but I am still waiting on information on how much we have saved by archiving it.
', N'01 - Imagens/02 - Depois/9901.jpeg', N'Saved cost by archiving the project. As anyone who would have known to do this was now gone, I confirmed with the NFLD team members that the project was no longer active and that all required documentation had been migrated elsewhere, and closed/archived the project in Aconex.', NULL, N'Yes', N'Review Licenses when responsible person required to maintain licenses leaves', 585540, 3, N'5S', '2026-04-22T00:00:00.000', '2026-05-07T11:49:27.000', N'81049746', NULL, NULL);
