', NULL, N'The initial goal was to ensure chemicals were offloaded in the correct designated area using a reliable visual verification method. This was not consistently achieved with colour‑coded tags, which were often not returned or issued. The new standardized stick‑on label process meets the original objective by embedding clear, permanent visual controls into the offloading process, improving verification, consistency, and compliance while reducing reliance on human behaviour.', N'Incorporating permanent, standardized visual controls into the chemical offloading process reduces reliance on human behaviour and strengthens chemical handling risk management into the process to be effective.', 0, NULL, N'Redução do tempo para localizar e selecionar TAGs
