', N'Ensure continuous availability of gasoline and diesel to support operations', N'0', N'01 - Imagens/01 - Antes/10009.jpeg', N'We experienced several incidents where gasoline/diesel ran out. Although daily tank dips were being completed, the readings were not communicated to supervisors, so fuel was not ordered when levels became low.
