Full internal autonomy of system Enhanced Data Tracking:
Expands Daily, Time & Labour Report to include more fields for improved productivity tracking and reporting by process.

Flexible Payments Options:
Enables multiply payment approaches (% vs dollar amount vs monthly average) to meet business requirements (e.g. grievance resolutions); Full Autonomy, No Reliance on External Vendors; Ability to make system changes / enhancements internally; Faster resolution of system issues.', NULL, N'Yes, the problem was solved', N'INFOSYS has great resources to be able to develop systems internally without going to external vendors.  I believe they could have developed the entire payroll system with all functionalities required for Operations if HRSA would have sourced them.', 0, NULL, N'A MELHORIA CONTRIBUI PARA REDUÇÃO DOS RISCOS DE TOMABAMENTO, DANOS AOS EQUIPAMENTOS E ACIDENTES COM OS COLABORADORES, ALÉM DE OTIMIZAR O PROCESSO DE MANUTENÇÃO E FORTALECER A CULTURA DE PREVENÇÃO, ORGANIZAÇÃO E SEGURANÇA OPERACIONAL NA ARÉA DE FILTRAGEM', '2026-06-05T00:00:00.000', '2026-06-05T14:33:09.000', N'200841', NULL, NULL);
